    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5734dfbf-883a-35f3-81f4-e672ce1d2e4e",
                "word": "misbegotten",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ba990c89-65ed-4349-93d1-72bfa48eea78",
                        "entry_id": "5734dfbf-883a-35f3-81f4-e672ce1d2e4e",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more misbegotten"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "d3b108b8-4eeb-450e-bebf-a2863056756e",
                        "entry_id": "5734dfbf-883a-35f3-81f4-e672ce1d2e4e",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most misbegotten"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9f149fc-b7e4-35f9-ba7a-e9eab411add0",
                        "entry_id": "5734dfbf-883a-35f3-81f4-e672ce1d2e4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Born out of wedlock; illegitimate."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of a person"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f4e51a9-0d64-47b5-83e1-8869ed1da23c",
                                "sense_id": "a9f149fc-b7e4-35f9-ba7a-e9eab411add0",
                                "text": "But as the Deuill would haue it, three miſ-be-gotten Knaues, in Kendall Greene, came at my Back, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5e8b276-0da9-414d-9af1-38408cfe13f8",
                                "sense_id": "a9f149fc-b7e4-35f9-ba7a-e9eab411add0",
                                "text": "“Foolish woman!” responded the physician, half coldly, half soothingly. “What should ail me to harm this misbegotten and miserable babe? The medicine is potent for good, and were it my child—yea, mine own, as well as thine! I could do no better for it.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0d99644f-3026-3b68-bec1-3da44c3101a7",
                        "entry_id": "5734dfbf-883a-35f3-81f4-e672ce1d2e4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ill-conceived."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "617773d8-bc6e-4161-b26f-f5d2421f8a3e",
                                "sense_id": "0d99644f-3026-3b68-bec1-3da44c3101a7",
                                "text": "Many of the strangest, most misbegotten studio films of the last 20 years have been comedies, perhaps because middle-aged executives have no comprehension of what the younger generation finds funny."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d39665d9-734b-38ae-9188-bb36451576e0",
                        "entry_id": "5734dfbf-883a-35f3-81f4-e672ce1d2e4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Bad; worthless."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4592ac2c-d75a-4d29-b1a7-3c5a337875ba",
                                "sense_id": "d39665d9-734b-38ae-9188-bb36451576e0",
                                "text": "Rather, as there was something abnormal and misbegotten in the very essence of the creature that now faced me—something seizing, surprising and revolting—this fresh disparity seemed but to fit in with and to reinforce it;[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6c0cea3-a560-4fe4-86fd-48f9d0f67215",
                                "sense_id": "d39665d9-734b-38ae-9188-bb36451576e0",
                                "text": "\"Do they not sneakingly bestow on me their crass inability to do anything with their own misbegotten progeny, a subterfuge which I scornfully fub off on text-books?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36fd01e4-f91f-4dc6-8e7c-ec0c0d8b5fb1",
                                "sense_id": "d39665d9-734b-38ae-9188-bb36451576e0",
                                "text": "There was the guy I spent a misbegotten night with who said he'd call me and never did but came to the party anyway, and I felt primed for a confrontation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "0424d073-69fc-3c7f-b31c-46fd86425a95",
                "word": "misbegotten",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "618e6ce3-d8ed-48eb-94d5-d16160024375",
                        "entry_id": "0424d073-69fc-3c7f-b31c-46fd86425a95",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "misbegotten"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b069c86a-b707-3350-836c-3401dd401687",
                        "entry_id": "0424d073-69fc-3c7f-b31c-46fd86425a95",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One born illegitimately (i.e., out of wedlock); a bastard."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "obsolete",
                            "sometimes"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4e7dc298-14ae-322b-bc52-3638c0fe05f3",
                        "entry_id": "0424d073-69fc-3c7f-b31c-46fd86425a95",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person born into infelicitous circumstances."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "in-plural"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30ad7dee-0465-455b-9cbe-60ea5e4ad6e2",
                                "sense_id": "4e7dc298-14ae-322b-bc52-3638c0fe05f3",
                                "text": "By preserving the incapable and “misbegotten”, and by insisting that they be the object of compassionate attention, it would cause even the strong to be infected with gloom and nihilism."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "46556c3c-2d8c-42e3-a39c-3160f45be6e4",
                        "source_entry_id": "0424d073-69fc-3c7f-b31c-46fd86425a95",
                        "source_sense_description": "people, considered as a class, born into infelicitous circumstances",
                        "target_lang_word": "misérables",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "misérables",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f616a1f-a25a-3530-a0f0-8af58678d756",
                                        "entry_id": "675caa6d-c78d-319c-83c2-47bf6a1612f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pluriel de misérable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2a570b4-3afe-4c9f-9d2e-e4604dc64c4a",
                                                "sense_id": "9f616a1f-a25a-3530-a0f0-8af58678d756",
                                                "text": "Je ne dégrogne pas contre ces misérables terres qui je prévois ne nous donneront jamais rien, mais ce n’est pas notre faute."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "misérables",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f975adf4-ebde-3a0f-8624-edb9c3149fc5",
                                        "entry_id": "5c0b6a4e-1288-3ce0-900c-e8157348d4e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pluriel de misérable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f333230c-8b15-4467-90f0-0a940c2840aa",
                                                "sense_id": "f975adf4-ebde-3a0f-8624-edb9c3149fc5",
                                                "text": "Le roc lentement se meut et s’élève, tandis que se continue la lutte ; une peur croissante s’empare des misérables, de qui le courage faiblit ; ils hésitent ; mais toujours brave devant le danger, la jeune fille, d’un assaut terrible, heurte l’un des agresseurs qui perd pied et choit dans l’abîme où il disparaît en hurlant une malédiction aussitôt étouffée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
